{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QDimensionLayer","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QDimensionLayer","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.qDimensionLayer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.qDimensionLayer","kind":"def","line":13,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-dimension-layer.lean#L13-L26","doc":"The q-dimension layer: the codomain `R^|Par(n)|` of the δ_q\ndecoration (`def:delta-q-decoration`), one coordinate per partition\n`λ ⊢ n`, recording the per-irrep q-character that the Markov trace\ncollapses by summing.\n\nConcrete model: the indexing type for the per-irrep tuple is the finite\ntype of partitions of `n`, here the placeholder `Fin n` (matching the\n`delta_q` codomain model in `delta-q-decoration.lean`). The full\nper-irrep coordinate ring `R = ℤ[q^±1/2, (q-q⁻¹)⁻¹]` is the upgrade\ntarget shared with `delta_q`.\n\n-- Ref: [wenzl1988] Wenzl 1988, DOI 10.1007/BF01404457\n","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-dimension-layer","label":"def:q-dimension-layer","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-dimension-layer.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}